    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n73915" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁμό-χροος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, 
			contr.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁμό-χρους</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ουν</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>of one
				colour,</i> opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ποικίλος,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>HA</u>
				543a25
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				525a4
			</span></i> ; <i>alike in colour,</i> prob. in <i><span class="en">
