			</span></i> : heterocl.pl. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁμόχρους</span>
			(from <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁμόχροες</span>) <i><span class="en">
				Archig.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Paul.Aeg.
